  message: "P2 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 24d0b860ee; owner-requested re-check of the 51 open P2 violated/todo_hard/todo_soft items; fixtures and outputs under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p2_review_11012026/A1/). VERDICT: CURRENT (wrong binds reproduce). Symbols X@2, X@4, X.run@2, X.run@4, B, B.go, A.top but A::C / A::C.go. Edges: A.top {X.run} -> X.run@4 (Ruby: A::X@2); Z.go {A::X.run} -> X.run@4 (wrong); analyzer `extends Q < A::B::X -> X@2` (wrong) PLUS a linker-added `extends Q -> X@4`, so the survey shows TWO parents for one class. _get_enclosing_class_or_module (ruby.py:361) reads the direct name node; _lexical_nesting (:2458) feeds only _nested_candidates (:2479). ruby.py's 3 commits since 10-25 touch none of the three functions. ROOT-CAUSE GROUPS: owner/container read from the name node, not lexical position (with INV-tohuj, WI-sipoj; fixed precedent WI-gikuk/WI-kosar); the second extends edge is the inheritance-linker re-resolution of WI-ligin. Status unchanged."  # 1c56
